          "user": "U09MGUVJ8BV",
          "userName": "戸塚直道",
          "userRealName": "戸塚直道",
          "text": "<@U09MM9KS06S> ソニーの開発18ヶ条、実際、こんな感じでしょうか？ <https://x.com/ict_community_/status/1985853314928689300?s=46&amp;t=qYXtM8jhwHon9wIwyIx_DQ|https://x.com/ict_community_/status/1985853314928689300?s=46&amp;t=qYXtM8jhwHon9wIwyIx_DQ>",
          "rawText": "<@U09MM9KS06S>\nソニーの開発18ヶ条、実際、こんな感じでしょうか？\n<https://x.com/ict_community_/status/1985853314928689300?s=46&amp;t=qYXtM8jhwHon9wIwyIx_DQ|https://x.com/ict_community_/status/1985853314928689300?s=46&amp;t=qYXtM8jhwHon9wIwyIx_DQ>",
          "messageTs": "1762382611.668259",
          "threadTs": "1762382611.668259",
          "parentUserId": null,
          "subtype": null,
          "date": "2025-11-05",
